<view class="container {{elder ? 'elder' : ''}}">
  <view class="profile">
    <view class="avatar">辨</view>
    <view class="pname">辨是非</view>
    <view class="pmeta muted">帮您看清消息真假</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 打赏卡片 -->
  <view class="tip-card" bindtap="onTip">
    <view class="tc-left">
      <view class="tc-title">支持「辨是非」持续免费 ☕</view>
      <view class="tc-sub">一杯奶茶钱，帮更多长辈远离骗局</view>
    </view>
    <view class="tc-btn">打赏</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="row between">
      <view class="label">长辈模式（大字）</view>
      <switch checked="{{elder}}" bindchange="toggleElder" color="#185FA5" />
    </view>
    <view class="hint muted">字更大、行更松，适合老花眼长辈使用。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card menu">
    <view class="mi" bindtap="onTip">
      <text>👍 打赏支持我们</text><text class="arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="mi" bindtap="onAbout">
      <text>关于辨是非</text><text class="arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="mi" bindtap="onDisclaimer">
      <text>免责声明</text><text class="arrow">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip muted">
    本结论由人工智能生成，仅供参考。遇到要钱、要验证码、要你点链接的，先别动，打 96110 问一问。
  </view>

  <tip-sheet visible="{{tipVisible}}" bind:close="onTipClose" bind:success="onTipSuccess"></tip-sheet>
</view>
